{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pumpkin Reaper</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >is a dark fantasy action RPG with Rogue-like elements. Unlike traditional heroes, Jack draws power not for himself\u2014but for the summons, or plants, he commands. Players will summon, upgrade, and strategically empower a variety of monstrous minions to fight through waves of twisted Halloween abominations, uncover forbidden relics, and shatter the control of hell itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125070/extras/574aacf787c1dba5c96228e3634e1947.poster.avif?t=1761367444\" width=1170 height=636 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125070/extras/574aacf787c1dba5c96228e3634e1947.webm?t=1761367444\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125070/extras/574aacf787c1dba5c96228e3634e1947.mp4?t=1761367444\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Become A Necromancer or Druid.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After awakening dark necromantic powers, Jack turns against the forces of Halloween that once controlled him. No longer a mindless villain, he seeks freedom from the infernal chains that bound him. He can either use the very powers that awoke him or lean into his roots and command nature to do his bidding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125070/extras/3bc50d87dc677c7da6e0c276bcb8a865.poster.avif?t=1761367444\" width=1170 height=636 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125070/extras/3bc50d87dc677c7da6e0c276bcb8a865.webm?t=1761367444\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125070/extras/3bc50d87dc677c7da6e0c276bcb8a865.mp4?t=1761367444\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125070/extras/6be812e3250bd15a2480a07bbad55227.poster.avif?t=1761367444\" width=1170 height=636 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125070/extras/6be812e3250bd15a2480a07bbad55227.webm?t=1761367444\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125070/extras/6be812e3250bd15a2480a07bbad55227.mp4?t=1761367444\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lightweight and Fast runs (10-15 minutes per run)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various of weapons to choose from (ricochet bullets, pass through, mega fireballs, and many more!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive waves lasting 30 to 90 seconds each and kill off as many halloween horrors as you can</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summon various minions or plants to aid you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Metaprogressions that change the way you play the game entirely</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125070/extras/1fbe1ce23cbc3f4c3664decf654722fd.poster.avif?t=1761367444\" width=1170 height=636 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125070/extras/1fbe1ce23cbc3f4c3664decf654722fd.webm?t=1761367444\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125070/extras/1fbe1ce23cbc3f4c3664decf654722fd.mp4?t=1761367444\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4125070?t=1761367444","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4125070?t=1761367444","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125070/5f3d1f74267b924205e8c2ba571912ecb6f60bfe/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761367444","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125070/5f3d1f74267b924205e8c2ba571912ecb6f60bfe/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761367444","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pumpkin Reaper</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >is a dark fantasy action RPG with Rogue-like elements. Unlike traditional heroes, Jack draws power not for himself\u2014but for the summons, or plants, he commands. Players will summon, upgrade, and strategically empower a variety of monstrous minions to fight through waves of twisted Halloween abominations, uncover forbidden relics, and shatter the control of hell itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125070/extras/574aacf787c1dba5c96228e3634e1947.poster.avif?t=1761367444\" width=1170 height=636 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125070/extras/574aacf787c1dba5c96228e3634e1947.webm?t=1761367444\" typ